WEBVTT

00:04.560 --> 00:05.479
I was right!

00:05.480 --> 00:06.440
It is coming!

00:06.730 --> 00:08.570
The female-form Titan!

00:14.390 --> 00:17.389
The female-form Titan emerged again,

00:17.390 --> 00:21.660
defeating the members of the elite
Levi Squad one after another.

00:27.210 --> 00:28.499
I'll kill you!

00:28.500 --> 00:31.129
Blaming himself for having entrusted
the battle to his comrades,

00:31.130 --> 00:35.840
Eren transformed and battled
the female-form Titan.

00:38.260 --> 00:43.100
However, he is defeated and
captured by the female-form Titan.

00:48.200 --> 00:52.370
Give Eren back!

01:03.280 --> 01:07.049
No matter where she goes, I'll kill her,

01:07.050 --> 01:09.339
rip her wide open,

01:09.340 --> 01:12.800
and dig you out of that filth.

01:13.500 --> 01:15.570
Just hang on a little longer.

01:15.850 --> 01:17.358
Don't give up Eren.

01:18.542 --> 01:20.026
never give up!

01:26.820 --> 01:27.849
Wait!

01:27.850 --> 01:29.770
Wh-What are you...

01:31.990 --> 01:33.780
Fall back for now.

01:40.670 --> 01:42.030
Oh, my friend!

01:42.030 --> 01:44.550
This is a victory for us!

01:44.610 --> 01:47.710
Our fame starts here!

01:47.750 --> 01:48.810
Oh, my friend!

01:48.810 --> 01:54.010
Let us celebrate this victory for the next battle!

02:08.650 --> 02:14.190
"I died for naught"
I won't let it end like that for you

02:14.190 --> 02:19.450
until I am the last one standing

02:19.450 --> 02:22.430
The enemy is cruel... We will kill...

02:22.430 --> 02:25.470
The enemy is colossal... We will jump...

02:25.470 --> 02:29.110
In our hands we hold blades of glory

02:29.110 --> 02:31.390
and sing in the name of victory

02:31.390 --> 02:36.030
We bear the wings of freedom on our backs

02:37.350 --> 02:43.470
Swearing iron determination upon our hearts,

02:43.490 --> 02:48.010
we slash apart the circle of idiocy

02:49.590 --> 02:51.910
and soar through the sky

02:51.970 --> 02:56.170
with our wings of freedom

03:09.960 --> 03:14.960
The Defeated: The 57th Exterior Scouting Mission, Part 6

03:18.850 --> 03:20.380
Maintain this distance.

03:21.110 --> 03:22.799
She's probably tired.

03:22.800 --> 03:25.260
The pace she's keeping
isn't particularly fast.

03:25.600 --> 03:28.639
It seems like he was bitten
right out along with the neck.

03:28.640 --> 03:30.060
Is Eren dead?

03:33.080 --> 03:34.360
He's alive.

03:34.660 --> 03:37.149
Our target seems highly intelligent,

03:37.150 --> 03:40.149
and capturing Eren is
apparently her primary goal.

03:40.150 --> 03:42.420
If she wanted him dead, she
could've crushed him in her jaws.

03:43.660 --> 03:46.899
Instead, she's carefully
holding Eren inside her mouth

03:46.900 --> 03:48.200
while fighting to escape.

03:49.120 --> 03:51.849
Eating Eren may also have been her goal.

03:51.850 --> 03:54.040
If so, he would've ended up in her stomach.

03:54.350 --> 03:56.749
It makes more sense to assume he's dead.

03:56.750 --> 03:58.050
He's alive!

04:00.280 --> 04:01.300
I hope you're right.

04:03.490 --> 04:08.390
If only you'd protected Eren,
this never would've happened!

04:11.810 --> 04:13.329
Now I see...

04:13.330 --> 04:14.950
It was you back then.

04:15.410 --> 04:17.420
You're Eren's close friend.

04:19.810 --> 04:22.539
We'll focus all our manpower on one goal.

04:22.540 --> 04:25.619
First of all, forget about
killing the female-form Titan.

04:25.620 --> 04:28.660
But she killed so many of our comrades!

04:29.150 --> 04:32.809
So long as she can crystallize her
skin, there's no way we can kill her.

04:32.810 --> 04:34.170
Trust my judgment.

04:34.800 --> 04:38.489
We'll keep hoping that Eren is still alive,

04:38.490 --> 04:40.999
and attempt to rescue him
before she leaves the forest.

04:41.000 --> 04:42.799
I'll hack her up...

04:42.800 --> 04:44.780
You draw her attention!

05:43.830 --> 05:44.989
He's fast...

05:44.990 --> 05:48.100
He moves so quickly that she can't
get a chance to harden her skin!

06:00.710 --> 06:03.499
We can go for her neck!

06:03.500 --> 06:04.969
She's tired...

06:04.970 --> 06:06.510
I bet she can't move!

06:06.770 --> 06:07.630
I can kill her!

06:11.440 --> 06:12.310
Stop!

06:27.330 --> 06:28.280
Eren!

06:35.290 --> 06:36.040
Hey!

06:37.440 --> 06:38.830
We need to get out of here!

06:38.990 --> 06:39.980
Eren!

06:41.750 --> 06:43.189
I think he's okay.

06:43.190 --> 06:44.459
He's alive!

06:44.460 --> 06:45.500
Filthy, though.

06:46.020 --> 06:48.169
Don't worry about anything else.

06:48.170 --> 06:49.510
We're pulling back.

06:50.550 --> 06:53.709
Don't lose sight of your primary objective.

06:53.710 --> 06:56.770
Is it more important to get
the revenge you desire?

06:57.210 --> 06:59.770
Isn't he a dear friend of yours?

07:02.500 --> 07:05.270
No, I...

07:22.900 --> 07:25.040
They're returning already?

07:25.920 --> 07:27.639
What happened?

07:27.640 --> 07:29.229
No clue.

07:29.230 --> 07:32.970
I'll bet they're coming back with
a heap of corpses again, though.

07:48.770 --> 07:51.110
Erd is coming home.

07:55.460 --> 07:56.730
I see.

07:58.980 --> 08:02.500
You think Auruo will have time to come home?

08:03.190 --> 08:06.210
It couldn't hurt to make
dinner for him, just in case.

08:10.790 --> 08:12.840
Gunther's coming home.

08:17.230 --> 08:18.640
I see.

09:19.660 --> 09:22.200
This is the part I just can't get used to.

09:23.100 --> 09:25.000
Nobody gets used to it.

09:26.460 --> 09:29.719
How are my friends going to die?

09:29.720 --> 09:31.890
How am I going to die?

09:32.440 --> 09:34.920
It's all I can think about.

09:35.920 --> 09:38.720
I try not to dwell on it.

09:39.620 --> 09:42.739
If I imagined the way I'm going to die,

09:42.740 --> 09:45.880
I doubt I'd be able to fight at all.

09:47.180 --> 09:48.480
Yeah.

09:49.510 --> 09:51.420
You're right.

09:56.400 --> 09:58.550
How much longer will I be alive?

09:59.520 --> 10:02.490
You're living now, aren't you?

10:03.380 --> 10:05.629
For the moment.

10:05.630 --> 10:07.759
Isn't that a good thing?

10:07.760 --> 10:09.330
You're alive!

10:10.420 --> 10:13.420
How can you say that in front of
the corpses of those who died?

10:21.030 --> 10:24.570
I'm not even sure I can go home anymore...

10:28.460 --> 10:30.159
We're almost done.

10:30.160 --> 10:32.950
There were five casualties
we couldn't recover.

10:33.640 --> 10:35.549
Not even any parts of them?

10:35.550 --> 10:38.790
We couldn't get close enough
because of the Titans.

10:39.970 --> 10:43.780
It's probably better for the families
if we don't bring those back.

10:45.240 --> 10:47.049
Report them as missing.

10:47.050 --> 10:47.870
Yes, sir.

10:49.010 --> 10:53.069
We've sighted several Titans near the forest,

10:53.070 --> 10:55.460
but none are headed in our direction us yet.

10:55.930 --> 10:57.090
We're moving out now.

10:57.660 --> 10:59.369
Inform the squads.

10:59.370 --> 11:00.369
Yes, sir.

11:00.370 --> 11:03.099
I refuse to accept this, Commander Erwin!

11:03.100 --> 11:04.809
Hey, you...

11:04.810 --> 11:06.749
We should recover them!

11:06.750 --> 11:09.769
Ivan's body was right in front of us!

11:09.770 --> 11:12.379
There was a Titan right next to him!

11:12.380 --> 11:14.109
We'd just end up losing someone else!

11:14.110 --> 11:17.759
If they attack us, we can just take them out!

11:17.760 --> 11:20.599
Ivan and I are childhood
friends from the same village!

11:20.600 --> 11:22.279
I know his parents.

11:22.280 --> 11:24.879
If nothing else, I'd at least
like to bring him home!

11:24.880 --> 11:26.209
Stop being selfish!

11:26.210 --> 11:27.820
Quarreling children?

11:28.370 --> 11:30.349
Captain Levi!

11:30.350 --> 11:33.420
If you confirmed he's dead, that's enough.

11:33.880 --> 11:37.319
Whether or not you have a body, dead is dead.

11:37.320 --> 11:39.300
It doesn't change a thing.

11:40.000 --> 11:41.200
That's...

11:41.910 --> 11:44.809
We'll say Ivan and the others are missing.

11:44.810 --> 11:46.279
That's my final decision.

11:46.280 --> 11:47.450
Leave it at that.

11:50.520 --> 11:52.189
Don't either of you

11:52.190 --> 11:55.869
possess any human feelings at all?!

11:55.870 --> 11:58.360
Hey, Dieter! You're getting too far ahead!

12:43.730 --> 12:44.960
Titans!

12:52.550 --> 12:53.600
That's...

12:55.520 --> 12:56.850
Dieter!

13:00.510 --> 13:02.020
That fool...

13:05.180 --> 13:07.110
The rear guard has sighted Titans!

13:08.000 --> 13:09.610
Full speed ahead!

13:09.840 --> 13:13.719
I don't see any tall trees or buildings.

13:13.720 --> 13:16.179
It will be difficult to fight out here.

13:16.180 --> 13:18.450
We're better off trying
to outrun them to Walls.

13:44.780 --> 13:46.979
They're gonna catch us!

13:46.980 --> 13:49.269
Will we have to fight?

13:49.270 --> 13:52.199
3D Maneuver Gear has limited
functionality in open areas!

13:52.200 --> 13:53.200
And look...

13:53.790 --> 13:55.360
They just keep coming!

13:56.090 --> 13:58.790
Then what'll we do?

14:01.340 --> 14:02.850
We...

14:38.650 --> 14:40.449
No! They'll catch us!

14:40.450 --> 14:42.209
I'll circle behind them!

14:42.210 --> 14:43.869
When I draw their attention, you...

14:43.870 --> 14:44.960
No.

14:45.320 --> 14:47.409
Just abandon the corpses.

14:47.410 --> 14:49.039
Otherwise they'll catch us.

14:49.040 --> 14:50.010
B-But...

14:50.730 --> 14:54.629
On past expeditions, dozens
of bodies never made it back.

14:54.630 --> 14:57.140
These guys will be no different.

14:58.300 --> 14:59.780
Are we doing this?

15:00.360 --> 15:01.980
We're seriously dumping them?!

15:06.560 --> 15:07.810
Damn it...

15:10.010 --> 15:11.990
We have no choice!

15:41.040 --> 15:42.519
Okay!

15:42.520 --> 15:44.850
Keep on going!

15:56.430 --> 15:59.549
As soon as we ascertain our
location, we'll depart.

15:59.550 --> 16:01.030
Stay alert!

16:01.240 --> 16:04.040
We'll have to take a slight
detour to the east...

16:12.360 --> 16:14.050
Captain Levi...

16:14.800 --> 16:16.310
I...

16:19.660 --> 16:22.020
This proves that they were alive.

16:23.420 --> 16:25.060
To me, at least.

16:29.610 --> 16:30.960
This was Ivan's.

16:36.960 --> 16:38.320
Captain...

16:55.240 --> 16:57.030
We're leaving!

17:16.200 --> 17:19.450
Eren, you should give up
on joining the Recon Corps.

17:20.320 --> 17:24.039
What? You're going to
tell me it's stupid too?

17:24.040 --> 17:26.790
That's not it...

17:33.390 --> 17:35.839
The Recon Corps is back!

17:35.840 --> 17:37.659
The front gate's opening!

17:37.660 --> 17:38.719
Let's go, Mikasa!

17:38.720 --> 17:39.840
The heroes have returned!

17:59.630 --> 18:02.799
Only this many made it back?

18:02.800 --> 18:04.570
The rest of them must've been eaten.

18:05.310 --> 18:08.829
That's what you get when you
venture outside the walls.

18:08.830 --> 18:13.540
It's like all our taxes are
spent fattening up the Titans.

18:13.970 --> 18:14.830
Eren?

18:19.840 --> 18:21.260
What is it?

18:29.670 --> 18:30.850
Eren...

18:36.530 --> 18:37.770
Eren!

18:46.600 --> 18:47.680
Eren...

18:54.110 --> 18:55.950
Don't try to get up yet.

18:56.680 --> 18:58.140
Rest up.

18:59.400 --> 19:00.590
The female-form Titan?

19:01.910 --> 19:03.090
It escaped.

19:03.920 --> 19:05.489
Why?

19:05.490 --> 19:08.250
What happened to others?

19:09.040 --> 19:10.600
What about the plan?

19:11.380 --> 19:12.850
It failed.

19:13.280 --> 19:15.020
Lay still for now.

19:17.520 --> 19:18.860
What's going on?

19:19.870 --> 19:23.110
Did you save me again?

19:26.770 --> 19:29.680
We're almost to the Walls.

19:47.550 --> 19:50.439
Aren't a bunch of them missing
compared to this morning?

19:50.440 --> 19:51.699
Man...

19:51.700 --> 19:53.550
Far fewer...

19:53.910 --> 19:56.190
How horrible.

19:57.210 --> 20:01.439
Just this morning they left to raise
hell, but now they're back already?

20:01.440 --> 20:03.319
What was the point?

20:03.320 --> 20:04.700
Who knows?

20:04.726 --> 20:09.832
But judging by those gloomy expressions,
they managed to gobble up more of our taxes

20:16.880 --> 20:19.210
Eren, just bear with it.

20:30.060 --> 20:31.639
So cool!

20:31.640 --> 20:34.349
The Recon Corps are so awesome!

20:34.350 --> 20:37.720
They get their butts kicked,
but they keep on fighting!

20:57.479 --> 20:59.345
Captain Levi!

20:59.870 --> 21:01.750
My daughter is in your squad.

21:02.050 --> 21:03.629
I'm Petra's father.

21:03.630 --> 21:06.770
Before I see her, I wanted to talk with you.

21:07.380 --> 21:10.499
She sent me this letter.

21:10.500 --> 21:14.359
She said you respected her skills
enough to allow her join your squad.

21:14.360 --> 21:17.389
She swore she'd to devote herself to you.

21:17.390 --> 21:22.380
Well, I guess she's too starry-eyed
to consider her father's feelings!

21:23.790 --> 21:27.490
Anyway, as her father,

21:27.820 --> 21:31.349
I think it's still too early for her to marry.

21:31.350 --> 21:35.239
She's still so young, with
so much left to experience!

21:35.240 --> 21:38.359
Commander Erwin! Answer us!

21:38.360 --> 21:42.249
Did your expedition learn anything
worthwhile to can justify the body count?

21:42.250 --> 21:45.870
Do you really believe the
dead leave no regrets?

21:48.930 --> 21:53.755
The costs and casualties of the
failed expedition were easily enough

21:53.760 --> 21:57.879
to discredit the faction that
had supported the Recon Corps.

22:08.088 --> 22:13.044
As those responsible, including
Erwin, were summoned to the capitol,

22:14.177 --> 22:16.418
it was decided that Eren would be handed over.

22:36.200 --> 22:41.590
If we suppose that I am not me,

22:41.590 --> 22:46.130
Can you say with certainty that you are you?

22:46.780 --> 22:51.660
Will you be able to pick up after yourself

22:51.660 --> 22:56.810
Once your sand-like shell breaks and your heart crumbles?

22:57.090 --> 23:02.020
I could hear someone calling

23:02.310 --> 23:05.920
But now my ears are just ringing

23:06.240 --> 23:11.080
It's as if time has frozen

23:11.380 --> 23:13.990
Now, wake up

23:13.990 --> 23:18.960
I began to walk through a deep dark abyss

23:19.510 --> 23:24.260
As swift as a gale, I escaped for my life

23:24.670 --> 23:28.830
I felt like a living corpse

23:29.240 --> 23:33.960
We break out of our walls

23:34.270 --> 23:40.350
To reunite in worlds we've yet to map

23:53.203 --> 23:58.530
That day, Annie was serving as an escort for Eren and the others on the way to the capital.

23:59.155 --> 24:01.911
Then, Armin suddenly appears,

24:02.337 --> 24:04.964
asking her to participate in a certain top-secret mission.

24:04.964 --> 24:05.933
Smile: Assault on Stohess, Part 1
asking her to participate in a certain top-secret mission.

24:05.933 --> 24:08.930
Smile: Assault on Stohess, Part 1
